IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256). 01 G PIC 9 VALUE 1 IS GLOBAL. 01 L PIC 9 VALUE 0. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY G.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING G DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. CALL 'CHILD'. DISPLAY L.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING L DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "0"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [0] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. DISPLAY G.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING G DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "9"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [9] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. CHILD. PROCEDURE DIVISION. MOVE 9 TO G. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM CHILD. END PROGRAM T.

